---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Animation from '../../components/animations/AIAutomationAnimation.astro';
---
<Base>
<section class="section service-page-example"><p class="eyebrow">Core IT operations</p><h1>AI &amp; Automation</h1><p class="lead">Repeatable request workflows with human review.</p><Animation /><div class="offering-detail" id="ai-automation-details" role="region" aria-labelledby="ai-governance-title">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">AI governance</p>
            <h2 id="ai-governance-title">Use AI with clear controls.</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>Define permitted uses, information access and human review. These controls do not make AI use risk-free.</p>
            <p>Start with one repeatable task: inputs, expected output and who checks it. Agree scope and controls before introducing the workflow.</p>
            <a class="scene-link" href="/resources/ai-governance/">Read the AI Governance Playbook</a>
          </div>
        </div></section>
<section class="cta"><h2>Bring the context. We'll start there.</h2><a class="btn white" href="/contact/">Talk to our team</a></section>
</Base>
